        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚀 Front-End Developer (Next.js)\n📍 Location: Near Jail Chowrangi, Karachi\nWork Arrangement: On-site\n💼 Job Type: Full-Time\n💰 Salary: Negotiable\nPosted: 2026-10-13\n\n🔗 Full details: https://lnkd.in/dH8JtUTf",
          "posted_at": "2026-10-13T10:45:07.970Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/hafiz-muhammad-saad-hr_hiring-frontend-engineer-react-nextjs-share-7518337823704346624-jjte": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T20:40:09.105527+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring: *Frontend Engineer* (React / Next.js / TypeScript) \n📍 Employment Type: Full-Time \n💼 Experience Required: 4+ Years \n Location: *Karachi (Hybrid/Remote)* \n\nAbout the Role\n Were looking for a highly skilled Frontend Engineer with deep expertise in React, Next.js, and TypeScript to help build fast, accessible, and scalable web applications. In this role, you'll take ownership of features from concept to deployment, collaborating closely with product, design, and backend teams to deliver exceptional user experiences.\n Key Responsibilities\n✅ Build and maintain production-grade applications using React, Next.js, and TypeScript ✅ Design reusable, scalable, and well-tested frontend architectures \n✅ Implement SSR, SSG, and ISR using the Next.js App Router \n✅ Integrate REST and GraphQL APIs while managing client/server state efficiently \n✅ Optimize applications for performance, accessibility (WCAG), and SEO\n✅ Convert Figma designs into pixel-perfect, responsive user interfaces \n✅ Write unit, integration, and end-to-end tests and participate in code reviews \n✅ Contribute to CI/CD pipelines and frontend tooling improvements\n\n Required Qualifications \n✔ 4+ years of professional frontend development experience \n✔ Expert-level proficiency in React and modern JavaScript (ES6+) \n✔ Strong hands-on experience with TypeScript in production environments \n✔ Extensive experience with Next.js (App Router, routing, rendering strategies, data fetching) \n✔ Solid understanding of state management tools such as Redux Toolkit, Zustand, and TanStack Query (React Query) \n✔ Experience with Tailwind CSS, CSS Modules, or CSS-in-JS solutions\n ✔ Proficiency with Git and collaborative development workflows \n✔ Experience with testing frameworks such as Jest, React Testing Library, Cypress, or Playwright \n\nNice to Have \n➕ Experience working with monorepos (Turborepo, Nx) \n➕ Familiarity with Node.js and full-stack development \n➕ Knowledge of design systems and component libraries (Radix UI, shadcn/ui, MUI) \n➕ Experience with GraphQL (Apollo, urql) \n➕ Exposure to cloud platforms such as Vercel or AWS and observability tools\n\n How to Apply \nSend your resume to afshan.iqbal@conurets.com\n\n🚀 Daily Jobs | ATS Resume Tips | Interview Guidance\n🔹 LinkedIn: https://lnkd.in/dpy2K9zr\n🔹 Facebook: https://lnkd.in/dMa_nRid\n🔹 WhatsApp:https://lnkd.in/dYhFB_2Z",
          "posted_at": "2026-10-20T15:50:21.589Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/karachi-jobsz_hiring-full-stack-web-developer-key-responsibilities-activity-7495034246613573632-U4Tb": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T20:40:09.105527+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring: Full-Stack Web Developer\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\nDevelop modern, responsive web applications using React.js / Next.js\nBuild scalable backend services and RESTful / GraphQL APIs (Node.js or Python/FastAPI)\nIntegrate AI/ML model APIs and manage inference endpoints\nDesign and maintain relational and NoSQL databases (PostgreSQL, MongoDB)\nSet up and maintain CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions, Docker, Kubernetes)\nDeploy and manage cloud infrastructure on AWS, GCP, or Azure\nImplement authentication, authorization, and security best practices\nMonitor application performance, uptime, and optimize for Core Web Vitals\nUse AI app builders (Lovable, Replit, v0) to rapidly prototype and scaffold new web features\n\nRequirements:\n\n3+ years of full-stack web development experience\nProficiency in React.js and at least one backend framework (Node.js/Express or Python/FastAPI)\nSolid understanding of databases, data modeling, and query optimization\nExperience with containerization (Docker) and basic Kubernetes orchestration\nFamiliarity with cloud services: storage, serverless functions, and managed databases\nUnderstanding of web security: OWASP Top 10, OAuth 2.0, JWT\nDemonstrated hands-on proficiency with AI development tools: Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT, Cursor, Lovable, and Replit — portfolio evidence required\n\nLocation: Korangi Industrial Area, Karachi.\nApply now by sending your CV to: hr.talent@ideas.com.pk",
          "posted_at": "2026-08-17T08:30:15.340Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/karachi-jobsz_were-hiring-web-developer-frontend-php-activity-7476920524120604672-0VQx": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T20:40:09.105527+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "We're Hiring: Web Developer (Frontend + PHP / Next.js)\n\nPARADIGM DIGITAL SOLUTIONS (PVT) LTD is looking for a skilled Web Developer to build, maintain, and keep our websites running in top shape.\n\nIf you write clean code, care about performance, and like owning a site end-to-end, we'd love to hear from you.\n\nWhat we're looking for:\nStrong hands-on experience with HTML and CSS\nSolid PHP development skills\nProven experience with Next.js (and React, which it's built on)\nExperience with site health management diagnosing and fixing technical issues, performance monitoring, and general upkeep\nAttention to detail and a problem-solving mindset\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines\n\n📍 Location: DMCHS, Karachi (Onsite)\n🕘 Shift Timing: 8:00 PM – 5:00 AM\n🏢 Job Type: Onsite, Full-time\n\nSend your resume and portfolio to hr@paradigmdigitals.com",
          "posted_at": "2026-06-28T08:52:47.387Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/pakistan-it-jobs_hiring-backend-developer-nodejs-karachi-activity-7389224553194881024-m6qX": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T20:40:09.105527+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring: Backend Developer (Node.js) – Karachi, Onsite\nWe’re looking for a passionate Backend Developer with strong expertise in Node.js to join our growing tech team in Karachi.\n\nWhat We’re Looking For:\n2+ years of hands-on experience with Node.js & Express.js\nStrong understanding of APIs, RESTful services & database design (MongoDB/MySQL)\nExperience with version control (Git)\nProblem-solving mindset & teamwork attitude\n\nWhat You’ll Do:\nBuild and maintain scalable backend systems\nCollaborate with frontend and mobile teams\nOptimize APIs for performance and security\n\n📍 Location: Karachi (Onsite)\n 🕒 Job Type: Full-time\nsend your cv at : hr@asoratech.com",
          "posted_at": "2025-10-29T09:00:18.607Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sherin-lee-joseph_hiring-angular-developer-nodejs-nextjs-activity-7463223113414168577-lRUk": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T20:40:09.105527+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring: Angular Developer | Node.js | Next.js\nLocation: Karachi, Pakistan\nExperience: 4–6 Years\nJob Type: Full-Time\n\nWe are looking for a talented Angular Developer with strong experience in Node.js and Next.js to join our growing development team.\n\nRequired Skills:Angular,Node.js,Next.js,TypeScript\nREST APIs,MongoDB / PostgreSQL,Git\n\nResponsibilities: \nBuild scalable web applications\nDevelop responsive frontend interfaces\nCreate backend APIs using Node.js\nCollaborate with designers and developers\nOptimize application performance and scalability\n\nInterested candidates can apply - DM/email(sherin_lee@mvisionit.com)",
